# ROWNAA — Phase 1: Project Foundation & Database

> Build this phase entirely before writing any UI code. Every UI phase depends on this structure being correct.

---

## 1. Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend | Next.js 14 (App Router) | Dynamic forms, SSR for SEO, easy routing |
| Styling | Vanilla CSS (per Phase 0 architecture) | Full control, no AI defaults |
| Backend | Node.js + Express.js | REST API, flexible middleware |
| Database | PostgreSQL | Relational, supports one-to-many (business→cars) |
| ORM | Prisma | Type-safe DB queries, easy migrations |
| Auth | JWT + OTP (via SMS gateway) | Phone-based login as per spec |
| File Storage | Cloudinary or AWS S3 | Image/PDF uploads for documents |
| SMS Gateway | SSL Wireless or Twilio Bangladesh | OTP, booking notifications |
| Payment | SSLCommerz + bKash Checkout API | Advance payment as per spec |
| Maps | Google Maps Places API | Structured pickup area selection |
| Hosting | Vercel (Frontend) + Railway/Render (Backend) | Scalable, easy CI/CD |

---

